WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:08.669
Completed orders shows every finished order, and how the day or the week went. In this video, you’ll read the totals and ask Assist about them.

00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:15.046
Open Order Tracking, and click the Completed tab. Pick a period, from today to all time.

00:00:16.069 --> 00:00:25.968
At the top: orders, revenue, the average order, how long orders take, and how many were on time. Below, orders by day, the top items, and who completed them.

00:00:26.987 --> 00:00:32.342
Filter by location, pickup or delivery, or person, and export the list to a spreadsheet.

00:00:33.372 --> 00:00:39.580
Or ask Assist right on the page: what were the best sellers, and what barely sold? Which hours were busiest?
